{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"にゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/08/13/4179055/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にゃんにゃ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/08/13/4179055/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あなたを待ってる～？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼ひめちまってるー♡／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/08/13/4179055/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは全国ツアーのスタートが\n今週末から始まるとゆーことで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きゅんきゅん王国のみなさんの\nライブの準備をお手伝いするべく\nおさらいタイム(＊´ω`＊)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん僕に私に気づいて！というあなたは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/08/13/4179055/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぴんくのサイリウム"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/08/13/4179055/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんタオル"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/08/13/4179055/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんうちわ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/08/13/4179055/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんTシャツ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とかやってみてくれたら嬉しいなあ\n必ずキャッチするよ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとはおにゃのこちゃんたちは\nついんてーるとかりぼんとか挑戦してくれたら\nもっと嬉しくなっちゃう ⌒ﾟ( ･ᴗ･ )ﾟ⌒"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぼーいずのみんなは\nついんてーるしてもかわいいと思うけど\n蝶ネクタイとかかわいいよね＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな感じで女子力、いいえ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きゅんきゅん力！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高めでおなしゃす♡きゃぴ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめを思う気持ちと\nあとは元気を持って会場に来てくださいね\nしっかり寝てきてねー体力もたないよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"超絶久々に使ったひめたん絵文字"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/08/13/4179055/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/08/13/4179055/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなも使っていーよー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて、前回の乃木ののは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田花奈ちゃん\n伊藤かりんちゃん でした☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイドルヲタクと乃木坂ヲタク！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実際そんなに\nアイドルさんのお話しなかったかも\nでも楽しかったです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かりんちゃんは初の乃木ののとゆことでしたが\nなんだろ貫禄があったよね( ´ ▽ ` )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなりんもトークが面白いから\nなんかずーっとお喋りが止まんなかった！\n知的な3人だったね～もちろんひめたんも含め♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次回もお楽しみにっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/08/13/4179055/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎ天#6予告編公開されました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Japan Expo密着＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな頑張ってたよー\nもちろんレポする私たちも頑張ったよ\n観てね( ^O^ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/08/13/4179055/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/08/13/4179055/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの\nえくぼツンツンしたくなるの・・・\n何でだろう？？？\n( '-' )ノ)`-' )め"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/08/13/4179055/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"扇風機が好きなんだけど\n最初の手の振りが難しいです。\nコツを教えてください。\nさいき「ん・ちょっ・と・～」の歌詞の時に\n手でL・O・V・Eを作るんだよー♪\n扇風機のサビは細かい手の動きが多いから\nPVやライブDVDをいっぱい観てみてね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/08/13/4179055/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あすかりんがひめたんを\nビジネスパートナーって言ってるけど、\nどういうこと？？\n文字どおりだよねーあすかりん\nびじね～す\\( ˆoˆ)/\\(ˆoˆ )/♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/08/13/4179055/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんのいいところは、\nアホっぽいのに実は頭がいいところだと思う！\nありがとうよく言われる( ¯•ω•¯ )黙れ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/08/13/4179055/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"僕が「アイドルになりたい」というと\n大人は爆笑します。\n何で大人は差別するのですか？\nひめたんビームを見て僕が(笑)ってなるのと\n同じですか？\nだーかーら( ¯•ω•¯ )黙れ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/08/13/4179055/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの日記の\nコメント欄下２ケタに46を踏んだ方へ\n手書きでコメ返するコーナー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼ ひめたん46 ／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/08/13/4179055/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/08/13/4179055/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/08/13/4179055/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもたくさんのコメント\nありがとうございます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブのときどうやったら\nひめたん気づいてくれるかな？ってひとが\nいっぱいいたからまとめてみたよ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きゅんきゅん王国のみなさんは\n絶対ひとりひとり見つける！\nひめたんのことも見つけてねー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブのリハとか10thとかで\nばたばたしてるけど\n車酔いと戦いながら移動中の車で読んでるよ(*'v'*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとお風呂とか、寝る前とか\n何もやってないときはコメント読んでるの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんのおかげでプライベートもアイドル♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次回乃木どこ出ます( ˘ω˘ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"予告みてくれた方は\nわかるかなーと思うけど\nみーんな私服回です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"予告のねねちゃんが可愛くてひめたんもう満足。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから、\nかなりんブログのTIFレポみたけど\nSPL∞ASHみてくれたんだね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなりんありがとう♡\nみんなほんとにお疲れさまでした～＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜みんなと久々に会えて\nひめたんも頑張らなきゃって\n改めて感じました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(＊´・ω・＊)"}],"source":"archive"}